This MIT license covers the FIRST-PARTY work in this repository: the recipe and tooling
(tools/), the record of a dead end (patches/) and the documentation.

The one piece of third-party code this repository carries a patch against is plume
(https://github.com/renderbag/plume), MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 renderbag and contributors, which
RT64 uses as a submodule. RT64 (MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 RT64 Contributors) and N64Recomp (MIT,
Copyright (c) 2024 Wiseguy) are MIT as well. Two further libraries the recipe builds,
N64Recomp/N64ModernRuntime and N64Recomp/RecompFrontend, are GPL-3.0: no line of either is
reproduced here, and anything derived from them would have to carry THEIR license, not this one.

The game project, bryantmh/rush2recompiled (https://github.com/bryantmh/rush2recompiled),
publishes NO license, so no line of it is reproduced here - not the changes it needs for UWP, not
its CMake, not its headers.

This license does NOT and cannot grant rights in Rush 2: Extreme Racing USA, its code, its assets
or its trademarks.
This repository contains no game ROM, no game assets and no built executable. What is quoted
